Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.38,0:00:05.38,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:06.28,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.966,354.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,700,3660,4780)}Episode 36
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:06.28,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(635.966,545.251)\fade(255,0,255,0,700,3660,4780)}Pang Tong Presents \Nthe Chain-Link Stratagem
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:49.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(958.655,332.727)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4260,4620)}Cáo Cāo \NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have received the reports from the Jiangnan area.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:01:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gan Ning was beaten by \NZhou Yu for helping Huang Gai,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.78,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so he wishes to join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang Gai was beaten, so he sent Kan Ze to propose their surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether they are telling the truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,hard to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.71,0:01:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, do any of you wish to visit \NZhou Yu's camp to ascertain that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.22,0:02:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your servant, Jiang Gan, will go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:27.28,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4500,4860)\pos(357.319,497.727)}Jiǎng Gàn \NStyled: Zǐyì
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When you last went to Wu, \NGenerals Cai and Zhang were executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.44,0:02:32.16,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2900,3300)\pos(976.296,494.026)}Chéng Yù \NStyled: Zhòngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you wish to "persuade" Zhou Yu to surrender yet again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.07,0:02:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.21,0:02:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to go to Wu to discover the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi, you intend to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.62,0:02:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:03:02.60,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(380.504,500.455)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3940,4260)}Xú Shù \NStyled: Yuánzhí
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.67,0:03:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, last time I went to Eastern Wu, I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.98,0:03:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I am very ashamed of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.11,0:03:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I will risk my life to go to Eastern Wu again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If I cannot come back with news for you, you can have my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi's integrity is commendable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.21,0:03:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi, when you ferry across, do what you must.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you succeed or not, \Nreturn as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not act imprudently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This shows all of Cao Cao's naval bases.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.04,0:04:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The other day, both Kongming and I suggested fire to be used against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:30.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(338.824,486.623)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3460,3820)}Zhōu Yú \NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.78,0:04:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,However, on the wide Yangzi River,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,if one ship is on fire, the others will scatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, what do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:05:02.84,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960.577,494.026)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5180,5540)}Lǔ Sù \NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.93,0:05:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.30,0:05:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A great talent dwells in a mountain not too far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.24,0:05:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He is Pang Tong, styled Shiyuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,People call him the Fledgling Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.68,0:05:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, have you heard this saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.05,0:05:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sleeping Dragon and Fledgling Phoenix! \NEither one can bring peace."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.46,0:05:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,His abilities are not below Kongming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can ask him for a plan to defeat the Cao?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.77,0:05:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I have asked him in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.86,0:05:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He said that we must use the Chain-Link \NStratagem against Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,which calls for the Cao navy to remain stationary by fastening their ships together with chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:06:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, the Fire Strategy will be useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A Chain-Link Stratagem, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, the person who will present this plan to Cao Cao has to be Pang Tong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, Jiang Gan has arrived from Cao Cao's base to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.69,0:06:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the key to victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.67,0:06:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go to Pang Tong to prepare for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.73,0:06:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Jiang Gan in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.88,0:06:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.07,0:07:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't Gongjin greeted his old friend yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sir Jiang, the Chief Commander is furious to hear of your arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:15.06,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(263.529,487.792)}Caì Hé
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.10,0:07:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.82,0:07:27.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1011.86,501.819)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3500,3900)}Caì Zhōng
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That Jiang fellow is here again. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.57,0:07:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziyi, how could you lie to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.81,0:07:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We have been like brothers since childhood!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I come before you to talk as friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.68,0:07:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How could we lie to each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:08:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to persuade me to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Never, until the seas go dry and the rocks are dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,When we last met, we shared \Ngood wine and even slept together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.53,0:08:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined you would steal a \Nprivate letter and give it to Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,causing the deaths of Cai Mao and \NZhang Yun and ruining my operation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.78,0:08:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You visit me with malicious intentions!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were not for the sake of our friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.59,0:08:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I would kill you where you stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to send you back again,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.63,0:08:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but I must defeat the Cao in the next day or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, I have no idea what to do about this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I kill him, people will ridicule me as heartless,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.55,0:09:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but if we let him stay in the camp, he will leak our plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.70,0:09:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,we should send Ziyi to the \Nwestern mountains for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we defeat Cao Cao, we will send him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.25,0:09:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That is very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.49,0:09:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.13,0:09:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,See off Sir Jiang!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, you dare act so heartless, so heartless-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.95,0:09:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu, you are a heartless and immoral cretin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.93,0:09:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Ziyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You will have to put up with it for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, it won't do you any good \Nif Gongjin becomes even more furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}In the days Fu Xi ruled the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:44.96,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Fu Xi was the first of the legendary Three Sovereigns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}a dragon-horse came out of the Yellow River.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.01,0:10:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}On its body was a diagram, called the "River Chart."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}When King Yu tamed the Yellow River,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}a divine turtle carried an inscription on its back
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.19,0:11:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}called the "Luo Stream Inscription."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.15,0:11:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}The Chart and the Inscription are thus Diagrams of Heaven and Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.68,0:11:27.48,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Referring to "{\fnSimSun\fs20}河图洛书"{\fn\fs} (River-Chart and Luò-Inscription); Cosmological diagrams that is the basis of Yin-Yang and the Five Phases of Chinese philosophy. \NIn legend, it's passed down from the Heavens as a sign of benevolent rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.03,0:11:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}They are the roots of all thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}and the bud of all governing laws,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}understood neither by man's power nor wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.58,0:11:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is sighing outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.28,0:11:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for disturbing you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.47,0:11:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask who you are, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:57.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(968.835,525.194)}Páng Tǒng \NStyled: Shìyuán
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Pang Tong of Xiangyng.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you are the Fledgling Phoenix?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.63,0:12:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask for your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Jiang Gan of Jiujiang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Ziyi, a prominent personage from the Yangzi-Huai regions?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We can continue in my humble abode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.33,0:12:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.72,0:12:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:12:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.93,0:13:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.17,0:13:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.27,0:13:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have long heard of your great name, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.99,0:13:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you hidden away in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to serve Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but Zhou Yu was too arrogant to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.63,0:13:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, I live here in solitude now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.05,0:14:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this fragrant tea from Yunshan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.99,0:14:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a connoisseur of tea as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.77,0:14:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This tea is sweet, without bitterness; \Nsmooth, not astringent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It is bright in color and pure of taste, \Nand its fragrance satisfies without even a sip!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.73,0:15:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No other tea can match up to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I admire your gracefulness, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.06,0:15:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You flatter me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.46,0:15:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am but a common man with some knowledge on tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Shiyuan,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor Cao is gifted in civil and military affairs. \NHe recognizes the worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.79,0:15:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,With your wisdom, if you were to serve him,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,you would help accomplish great deeds \Nand go down in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.11,0:15:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've wanted to leave Jiangdong for a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.24,0:15:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but there was no one to lead me to Lord Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.09,0:16:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.70,0:16:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take care of this problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.75,0:16:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, we'd best cross the \Nriver as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.89,0:16:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Any delay, and I fear \NZhou Yu would kill us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.77,0:17:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night, I met with Chancellor Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.90,0:17:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He was going to meet you tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.23,0:17:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but feared it would be discourteous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.48,0:17:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Fledgling Phoenix! Sir Fledgling Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.00,0:17:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My respects to the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:17:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No need, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.77,0:18:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said he who has the Sleeping Dragon or the Fledgling Phoenix will have the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.05,0:18:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Never did I imagine Zhuge Liang would foolishly \Nlower himself to serve Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Zhou Yu, he is young, yet he \Nlords over others and ignores advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.38,0:18:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I have long heard your great name. \NI am honored to have you here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I would appreciate your tutelage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You praise me too much, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We are holding a banquet to your honor in our tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.76,0:18:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.36,0:18:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. I know as well that you \Ncommand with a strategic mindset.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.49,0:18:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to observe your station, \Nthen we can attend the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.67,0:18:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, we will do as he says!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.92,0:18:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, prepare the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.19,0:19:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please. \N-Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.52,0:19:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.25,0:22:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}What a magnificent sight this fort is!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.99,0:22:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}The camp is flanked by hills and forests, guarded on all sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.46,0:22:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}All gates and roads for entry and exit are secured.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.30,0:22:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}It not only looks imposing from the outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.67,0:22:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}but the camp's operations within are also smooth and efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.29,0:22:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}Even if Sun Wu, Wu Qi, and Sima Rangju came back from the dead, they could not surpass this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.83,0:22:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}You are too kind! I look forward to further insights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.10,0:22:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}There are twenty-four openings facing south of this naval camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.65,0:22:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}The battleships are lined up like a wall, protecting the smaller vessels,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}moving to and fro in an orderly manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.80,0:22:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}Chancellor, your reputation as a strategist is well-earned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.05,0:23:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Ah, Zhou Yu, Zhou Yu! Your end is nigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.01,0:23:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I have long admired you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It is thanks to fate that I have the fortune to receive your teachings.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.70,0:23:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I am authorized by an imperial decree to go south and destroy Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I wish to hear any insight of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.57,0:23:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you treat worthy men with great respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.63,0:23:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel very touched by your generosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.35,0:23:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-Come. \N-Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.86,0:24:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.26,0:24:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I laugh at Zhuge Liang and Zhou Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.64,0:24:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang lacks political acumen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.49,0:24:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It is quite a pity that he is a handful of pearls cast aside, not understanding the course of Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.49,0:24:24.76,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: A handful of pearls cast aside is a Chinese idiom meaning someone appearing talented when they're actually not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.64,0:24:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kongming seems to have unworldly intelligence. \NI have fallen into his traps many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.29,0:24:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,May you elaborate on him \Nnot knowing the "course of Heaven"?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.94,0:24:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Kongming's strategic goal lies in Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.29,0:24:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}When Liu Bei paid him three visits,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.67,0:24:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Kongming told Liu Bei at Longzhong,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.26,0:24:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}"Jing Province lies north of the \NHan and Mian Rivers that lead to Nanhai,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.25,0:24:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}linked to Wu-Kuai in the east, \Nand adjoining Ba-Shu in the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.25,0:24:54.70,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Wu-Kuai covers modern-day Suzhou; \NBa-Shu covers modern-day Sichuan and Chongqing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.11,0:24:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}It is thus an important area to control."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.83,0:25:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}However, he fails to understand that this \Nstrategic location will be highly contested.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.72,0:25:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}After its seizure, he would have little time to deal with enemies at the front and the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.10,0:25:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}With that, how could he waste his strength in taking over Western Shu and fighting the southern barbarians?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.31,0:25:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}It is because of this that, \NKongming was defeated at Dangyang
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.44,0:25:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}and Jing Province fell into \Nyour possession, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.32,0:25:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Then what kind of man do you think Zhou Yu is?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.95,0:25:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Zhou Yu isn't even worth mentioning!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.48,0:25:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}He's brilliant at playing music and singing songs,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.29,0:25:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}yet his ability to command armies is but a hollow claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.06,0:25:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Furthermore, Zhou Yu is narrow-minded,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.79,0:26:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}and he cannot tolerate others.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.93,0:26:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}When Kongming ferried across to aid him,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.22,0:26:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}he instead attempted to kill Kongming over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.74,0:26:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}How can he achieve greatness through such infantile acts?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.57,0:26:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.00,0:26:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.05,0:26:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}May I ask you whether there are \Nany capable medics in the army?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.58,0:26:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Are you ill, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.94,0:26:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}I am fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.07,0:26:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Then what for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.70,0:26:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}The northern army is not used\N to the southern climate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.52,0:26:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}They will become ill after constant drilling at the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.74,0:26:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}What you say is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.85,0:26:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}Our men are suffering from it, \Nwith many vomiting and even dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.59,0:26:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Perhaps you have an idea to offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.99,0:27:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Sire, the way you train the marines is excellent,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.91,0:27:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}but it is not perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.10,0:27:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}I am open to your advice, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.44,0:27:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Imagine this as a ship on the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.36,0:27:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}The Yangzi River is wide, its tides ebb \Nand flow, and its winds never rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.00,0:27:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}With the northerners unused to all these waves, how can they not get sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.38,0:27:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}If all your ships, big and small, \Nwere arranged into rows,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.83,0:27:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}and divided into squads of 30 or 50 each,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.32,0:27:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}then they may be chained together, \Nand have wide planks placed between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.51,0:28:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}Then, your men and even their horses could move between them freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.34,0:28:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}With the ships securely connected,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.84,0:28:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}even when fierce winds and waves try to batter them,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.27,0:28:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}what is there to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.15,0:28:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you for your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.65,0:28:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Without this scheme of yours, how could I defeat Eastern Wu?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.14,0:29:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.14,0:29:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.81,0:29:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,After this banquet, do as Sir Pang instructed. \NForge iron chains and large bolts,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.74,0:29:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and lock the ships together.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.23,0:29:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.46,0:29:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fine sword, very fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.69,0:29:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you so wish, your Excellency may keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.25,0:29:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer to keep men of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.38,0:29:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,For you to desire worthy men like that, \Nyou are a wise lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.20,0:29:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.42,0:29:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.93,0:29:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I think back to that whelp, Zhou Yu. He is arrogant and deals out cruel punishments.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.79,0:30:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He is very much isolated, and lacks allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.19,0:30:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell that many great men in the Jiangdong region would wish to serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.31,0:30:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,With my silver tongue, I can easily convince them to join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.44,0:30:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Would Zhou Yu not be captured thereafter?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.49,0:30:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,With Zhou Yu's defeat, Liu Bei will be \Nput down without so much as a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.87,0:30:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Outstanding. If you render me this great service,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.44,0:30:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I will petition the throne to raise you as one of the Three Excellencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.84,0:30:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I come not for wealth or honor, \Nbut to save the people of Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.32,0:30:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have but one request.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.60,0:30:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.42,0:30:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,When your army crosses the Yangzi River, \Nplease do no harm to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.62,0:30:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I act on the behalf of Heaven. \NHow could I ever kill the masses?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.90,0:30:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Chancellor has won popularity in your expedition against Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.46,0:31:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Yuan Shao was powerful then, \Nwhile Sun Quan is weak now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.33,0:31:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If your men become cavalier and rapacious after your victory,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.18,0:31:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,they may burn and kill wantonly. \NHow will Chancellor deal with them then?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.10,0:31:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Have no worries sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.19,0:31:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me a brush and inkstone!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.72,0:31:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Fledgling Phoenix,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.51,0:31:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,whoever dares to violate my orders \Nshall be put to death, as written here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.56,0:32:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.66,0:32:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Excellency should attack as soon as \NI am gone, before Zhou Yu becomes aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.74,0:32:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,See Sir Fledgling Phoenix off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.47,0:32:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How bold of you, Pang Shiyuan!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.76,0:32:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You frightened me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.89,0:32:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang Gai used the Self-Injury Ruse, \NKan Ze presented a false surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.68,0:32:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you with the Chain-Link Stratagem.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.06,0:33:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Perhaps you fear that Cao Cao's \N830,000 troops will ravage Wu?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.21,0:33:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wily trick may have been enough to blind Chancellor Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.27,0:33:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but it has not fooled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.70,0:33:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were to reveal my plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.71,0:33:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the fate of all the people of the eighty-one districts \Nof Jiangnan will be sealed in blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.88,0:33:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And what of the fate of those 830,000 men?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.17,0:33:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They are also human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.32,0:33:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you only care for one side and not the other?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.44,0:33:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi, do you intend to ruin my plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.72,0:33:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never been able to repay the kindness \NImperial Uncle Liu gave to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.55,0:33:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother died because of Cao Cao; \NI swore then to never offer him one word of advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.69,0:33:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I wreck your great plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.86,0:33:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It is just that as soon as the war begins, \Nthere will be a sea of fire here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.02,0:33:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Many men from both sides \Nwill perish beneath the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.42,0:33:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How could my fate be any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.69,0:34:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I only ask you to think of a way out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.69,0:34:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi, you are a shrewd and perceptive man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.26,0:34:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you truly not think of a way to escape yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.90,0:34:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I am open to your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.79,0:34:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When you return Yuanzhi, you must have your men spread rumors in the camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.59,0:34:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,that Ma Teng and Han Sui of Xiliang have \Nrebelled and are on their way to attack Xuchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.47,0:34:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That will worry Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.00,0:34:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There, offer to undertake the defense of the passes to guard the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.37,0:34:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you not get away then?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.04,0:34:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Brother Shiyuan, for your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.00,0:34:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,May we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.35,0:34:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,May we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.05,0:34:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.88,0:35:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.85,0:35:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How lively their work is!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.45,0:35:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor Cao, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.48,0:35:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please look, Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.20,0:35:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They are making the chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.33,0:35:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.43,0:35:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.08,0:35:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.85,0:35:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.06,0:36:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The other day, there were rumors that \NHan Sui and Ma Teng of Xiliang had rebelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.98,0:36:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That had me worried for a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.90,0:36:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Thankfully, Xu Yuanzhi has put my mind at ease \Nby leading a detachment to guard the pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.98,0:36:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as the battleships are chained together, \Nthey will be ready to sail the Yangzi!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.20,0:36:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Wu's destruction is imminent!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.79,0:36:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.59,0:36:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go take a look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.42,0:36:46.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1030.165,511.169)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4180,4540)}Shī Xù
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.97,0:37:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.54,0:37:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cast them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.38,0:37:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.76,0:37:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shi Xu, Libationer Shi!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.50,0:37:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.89,0:37:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}Libationer Shi, you were in charge of palace court music,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.58,0:37:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}and you are the master of music under heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.31,0:37:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.94,0:37:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Ever since the nation has fallen to turmoil,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.18,0:37:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}many ancient ceremonial songs have been lost to the fires of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.54,0:37:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}I heard you have restored the ancient music and revised the notations.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.12,0:37:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.77,0:37:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}As ordered, I have tried to collect ancient \Nmusic notations across the land, with success.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.84,0:37:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}I recently arranged rehearsals of \Nceremonial music and dance in Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.36,0:38:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Everything is almost complete, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.73,0:38:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Oh? Is there an issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.71,0:38:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}It's just the tone of the bells for the ceremony is not ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.08,0:38:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}The Libationer demands much!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.60,0:38:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}Right now, I have a million soldiers, all armed and prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.36,0:38:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}One order from me, and the soldiers will trample across Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.23,0:38:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}I plan to hold a banquet on the tower ship \Non the 15th of this month
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.30,0:38:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}with your music to raise the morale of our army!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.35,0:38:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.25,0:38:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}Across all these years of fighting, \NI have written more than twenty ballads;
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.32,0:38:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}you may select one and compose music \Nin the ancient style for my ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.66,0:38:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.74,0:38:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879}The bells and their tune as well as the ballads \Nshall be perfected by the feast,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.89,0:39:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12.879\pos(640,664.179)}to celebrate Your Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.96,0:39:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Music to my ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.50,0:39:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it up, bring it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.88,0:39:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.81,0:40:02.07,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.98,0:40:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
